<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Copyright (C) 2016 Patrick Mours. All rights reserved. License: <link xlink:href="https://github.com/crosire/blink#license">https://github.com/crosire/blink#license</link> Microsoft program debug database file</para>

<para>File is a multi-stream file with various different data streams. Some streams are located at a fixed index:<itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Stream 1: PDB headers and list of named streams</para>
</listitem><listitem>
<para>Stream 2: Type info (TPI stream)</para>
</listitem><listitem>
<para>Stream 3: <link linkend="_namespace_debug">Debug</link> info (DBI stream) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</section>
